<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόσμ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοσμέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unarranged</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				506e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					781b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>not organized as a</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος, ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					4.3.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγχυσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					205
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of style,
				<i>unadorned</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>unfurnished with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					11.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
